  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fcd19b51b53d4f5a91a947cf67c81c88, type: 3}
  m_Name: FovereIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Fovere.DialogueData
  conversationBlock:
  - "Hey there! <pause=0.5>Welcome to Fov\u0113re! <pause=0.5><size=35>or atleast
    it will be...</size>"
  - This prototype only demonstrates some very basic systems implemented into the
    game so far. <pause=0.5>Like this cool dialogue!
  - Speak to different residents around to find out more about the systems implemented!
    <pause=0.5>Each of us have new information for you.
  - I hope you stay tuned to further progress with this game, <pause=0.5>a lot of
    time went into all the systems, <pause=0.5>and we can't wait to see how it comes
    along!
